                                "sense_id": "474473f6-f51b-3d93-86d4-1217570d150e",
                                "text": "Some others goe further and alledging or rather indeede abusing some peece of the Scripture[…]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2bf364d3-e5d7-4fde-bc52-5a761900acc7",
                                "sense_id": "474473f6-f51b-3d93-86d4-1217570d150e",
                                "text": "And God ſpake vnto Noah, ſaying, / Goe foorth of the Arke, thou, and thy wife, and thy ſonnes, and thy ſonnes wiues with thee:[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e221ee5-921f-4ebc-b3a0-c344cd010170",
                                "sense_id": "474473f6-f51b-3d93-86d4-1217570d150e",
                                "text": "With divers kinds of Riddance The smoaking Earth is wet, And all aflowe to seaward goe The Torrents wide of Sweat!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
